---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Tension privacy policy — how we handle your data. We collect only what's necessary.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: May 2026</em></p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you request the free checklist or join a product waitlist, we collect your email address. That's it. We do not collect names, addresses, payment details, or tracking cookies beyond session state.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>Your email is used to deliver the content you requested and to send the short follow-up series you signed up for. We do not sell, share, or rent your email address to any third party.</p>

    <h2>Email sending</h2>
    <p>We use Resend (resend.com) to send emails. Your email address is transmitted to Resend for delivery purposes only. You can unsubscribe from any email at any time using the link in the footer of any message we send.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use one functional cookie (<code>tension_ag</code>) to remember that you have confirmed your age. This cookie contains no personal data. We do not use tracking cookies, advertising pixels, or third-party analytics that fingerprint users.</p>

    <h2>Age-gated content</h2>
    <p>We gate adult content behind an age confirmation. We do not collect or store date-of-birth data — the confirmation is a self-attestation stored in a browser cookie.</p>

    <h2>Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your data at any time. To do so, email hello@tension.app with your request. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain email addresses for as long as you remain subscribed. When you unsubscribe, your address is removed within 7 days.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Privacy questions: hello@tension.app</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
